{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_03",
  "title": "假面舞池",
  "storyCode": "CR-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8374ebd111465e77b5f16f8077c37ededd429e98c755374f435c458cc0fde441",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告，药已经在地下库房里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和您指示的一样，我们学着那些人安置了炸弹，制造了一点混乱，就抢到手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可您怎么看着愁眉不展的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在想这批药该怎么脱手......就算改变包装销往地下市场，也很难不留下踪迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是怕有人查？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行动开展时我收到一条消息，罗德岛此次前来派送药物的人身份有些特殊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，我们行动时留意到了，那个男的是个熟面孔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可老潘乔现在人在监狱里，手下的人走的走，散的散。他儿子如今回到这里，未必还能像从前那样吃得开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可不一定，市政府之前有人透给我了些讯息，说坎黛拉在考虑培养自己的接班人，那小子正是几个考察对象之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可老潘乔和坎黛拉不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，坎黛拉用人可一向不避亲仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们怎么办......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得，上次雷内尔的小秘书来时和我们分享了一些资源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......有几家店铺和仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其中是不是有一家药企的仓库？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "药品嘛，多一车少一车，估计他们也不会太在乎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的意思是，把包袱丢给雷内尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话可不能这么讲，他们主动找上门合作，我们回些谢礼不也正常？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "久等了，埃内斯托先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有没有，我也是刚刚才来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，麻烦给我一杯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经为你点好了，布克先生，还是老样子，双倍浓缩，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离开这里这么久，难为你还记得我的习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这点时间，再久也久不过我们共事的时间嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "侍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位的咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢，嗯......不错，什么都是刚刚好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你走之后，再没人能像你一样做事面面俱到了，现在新来的小年轻啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再等等看吧，放在那个环境里，人变得很快的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，对了，坎黛拉女士托我把这份文件带给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "文件？坎黛拉女士有事情吩咐我去做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，是你要的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......我今天才来找你，话还没说出口呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一到多索雷斯，坎黛拉女士就知道消息了，又听说你们运送的货物遭人抢劫，肯定正着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "文件袋里是近些天物流与交通的异常数据，相关的地点与人员都有记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士这样挂心，我都不知道该如何感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长保镖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，讲什么感激，只要你也能记挂着我们大家就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这地方灰比货还多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾拉，你接到的到底是什么任务？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仓库的货物买来之后就滞销了，积压在仓库里足足有半年，只剩一个管理员看守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不相当于敞开大门放任别人来拿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，米沃什说几乎每天都会收到失窃报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是来追查丢失货物去向的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，这仓库只出不进已经是常态了，但昨天仓库看守人接到一通电话，说有一批药品会运过来，要他做好交接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米沃什觉得很蹊跷，让我们过来看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来者不善？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难说，这样一间仓库我看不出对方能有什么图谋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许米沃什只是想找个借口支开你和舒赫拉特，毕竟他好不容易空下来可以和雷内尔做点什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他大可以直说，我绝对不会出现在他俩一千米范围内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得出你真的对那家伙不太待见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想天天看那个家伙大门不出在阳台打高尔夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少他遵守了对你的承诺——安分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那份文件没有差错，诸多异常线索都汇集到了这里，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我们找到的地方看起来就是个废旧的破仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一会儿会有一批药物运抵这间仓库，等下看看是不是我们要找的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仓库里只有一个管理员，没有什么威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照出发之前定好的计划，在卡车驶进仓库后，已经潜入的特克诺会关闭监控，放我和你进入查看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一会儿啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（打哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_prison_commandroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——哈——困死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些药品到底什么时候能送到啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没劲，上面居然还派人来查看，有什么好看的。今天天气这么好，不如找块沙滩晒晒太阳，喝杯咖啡，听首歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在黑夜我与你跳起一曲无声的探戈♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碟片放在哪里了，哦，找到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在黑夜我与你跳起一曲无声的探戈♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看不清你的面容，只有你手心的温度♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......这才是生活嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啧，这家伙未免也太不专业了吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（既然这么想躺下好好睡一觉，满足你好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，得来全不费工夫，让我看看，监控在哪里......找到了，在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？不是说只有一个管理员，怎么仓库里还有四个人？谁啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......二位，我已经破坏掉监控了，有一个好消息与一个坏消息，好消息是我现在能确定，那批药物就是我们要找的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坏消息是，雷内尔的保镖也来了，四个人，全在仓库里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "什么？这地方平时不是根本没人会来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "呃，让我想想......我们人数不占优势。特克诺，你能断掉照明供电吗？我和阿莱塔或许可以偷偷摸黑突入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
