      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "见鬼，这孩子的力气比成人还要大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不是什么小孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩奋力挣开导火索的控制，狠狠地踩在了他的脚趾上。\n还没来得及感受来自脚尖的痛楚，女孩回身一记飞踢又狠狠冲向他的面门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔呃——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
