      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古斯塔夫？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特克诺？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撞在我手上算你倒霉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是法术闪光！快找掩体，艾拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特克诺，等等，这房间经不起你这么搞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小朋友，你的同伙在我手里，劝你不要轻举妄动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了，阿莱塔在他们手里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，不巧，我们这边也有你们的人质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是舒赫拉特！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑暗中，唯一的光源只有特克诺源石技艺发出的光芒，虽然不能照亮整间仓库，但看清彼此的脸庞还是足够的。\n所有人的视线不停转移，交错，擦过其余人的脸庞，并且在上面读到了一样的情绪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我觉得有些尴尬......到底为什么会陷入这样的情景......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，或许我们可以交换人质，然后各走各的路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺&艾拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们来这里到底是要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查清楚是谁在用这间仓库做交易，你又是来干什么，小朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到我们丢失的药品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们早就说过，药品不是我们抢走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？那你们为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说了，查清楚到底是谁在往这间仓库送东西！你们又是抱着什么目的来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们说过了！我们丢的药在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——真是和你们讲不通！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管理员在不在啊，货到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，跑这一趟累死人了......这地方也太偏僻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......我还有个提议，既然大家都想知道那批药到底是怎么回事，不如直接问问送药来的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
